File: contrib/dbs/tiff-grayscale.c
Line: 79
Function: main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: malloc() for 'gray' is not checked for failure; if malloc returns NULL, 'gray[0] = 3000;' dereferences a NULL pointer.

